---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for blueprintCoverage. Translate the assessment purpose into observable competencies and a balanced task blueprint. Distinguish intended skills from incidental reading or tool demands, and identify constraints on duration, accessibility, and allowable assistance. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
